Generate the completion script for the given shell and print it to stdout.

Usage: agent-cli completion bash|zsh|fish|powershell

Flags:
  -h, --help     Print help
  -v, --verbose  Print diagnostic details to stderr

Examples:
  agent-cli completion powershell | Out-String | Invoke-Expression

Environment: none
Exit codes: 0 ok · 2 usage error or unsupported shell
